        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana CF066, Solid Brass Small Window Lock Casement Fastener</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Small Window Lock Casement Fastener is easy to install. To fit most applications, it includes 3 different strike types: surface mounted, mortised and edge mounted. Replace your old worn and painted window locks with these solid brass ones for an all new look. Packaged with matching finish mounting hardware. Deltana is an architectural door and window hardware manufacturer famous for solid brass hardware with a proven record for exceptional quality. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DELCF066-Specifications.gif?v=1704354652\" width=\"536\" height=\"185\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana CF066 Small Window Lock Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-large-window-lock-casement-fastener-deltana-cf66\"><b>Larger Window Lock</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana CF066 Small Window Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lock Handle Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Handle Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Handle Plate Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Handle Plate Height: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Height: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Max Projection: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Height: 1-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes 3 different matching finish strikes.</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Small Window Lock Casement Fastener, Deltana CF066",
                "description": "Deltana CF066 Solid Brass Small Window Lock Casement Fastener - The Small Window Lock Casement Fastener is easy to install. To fit most applications, it includes 3 different strike types: surface mounted, mortised and edge mounted. Replace your old worn and painted window locks with these solid brass ones for an all new look. Packaged with matching finish mounting hardware. Deltana is an architectural door and window hardware manufacturer famous for solid brass hardware with a proven record for exceptional quality. ",
